DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");
Context()->operators->undefine('+','-','*','/');

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

- _For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._
- _For derivative problems, if the result is undefined, then *leave the blank empty*._

[`18+5+12-17/17`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>Formula('34'),width=>10}
---

What is the value of [`11/11+1/12`]? [_____]{answer=>1.08333333333,width=>4}
---

[`0+12-16-10/5`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>-6,width=>8}
---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
